 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAtelier Provence SAS                                      MASTER SERVICES\n12 Rue de la République, 69001 Lyon, France                     AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR10 504041066\nReg No: FR-455345\n\nFROM                                                     FACTURÉ À\nAtelier Provence SAS                                     Société Lumière SARL\n12 Rue de la République                                  12 Rue de la République\n69001 Lyon                                               69001 Lyon\nFrance                                                   France\nVAT: FR10 504041066\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 20/04/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Atelier\nProvence SAS, with its registered office at 12 Rue de la République, Lyon (\"Party A\"), and Société Lumière SARL, with its registered office\nat 12 Rue de la République, Lyon (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\nParty A      Atelier Provence SAS / Pierre Martin\nParty B      Société Lumière SARL / Pierre Martin\nDate         20/04/2026",
